{"seq":1,"slug":"kafka-in-depth","title":"Kafka 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/kafka-in-depth","wordCount":880,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"kafka-深度实践\">Kafka 深度实践</h1><p>Apache Kafka 是当今最广泛部署的分布式事件流平台，设计目标是在商用硬件上实现每秒百万级消息的持久化和消费。它的独特之处在于：消息不被消费后删除，而是按配置的保留周期持续存储，消费者通过维护自己的<strong>偏移量（Offset）</strong> 独立地在任意位置读取历史记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Topic</td>\n<td>消息的逻辑分类，物理上分为多个分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Partition</td>\n<td>有序不可变的消息序列，并行消费的基本单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Offset</td>\n<td>消息在分区内的顺序编号，消费者提交以标记处理位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consumer Group</td>\n<td>同组消费者分担分区消费，每分区同时只被一个消费者消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Broker</td>\n<td>Kafka 集群中负责存储和转发消息的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISR</td>\n<td>In-Sync Replicas，与 Leader 保持同步的副本集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心架构\">核心架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    P1[Producer A] --&gt; T[Topic: orders\\n分区 0 / 分区 1 / 分区 2]&#10;    P2[Producer B] --&gt; T&#10;    T --&gt; B1[Broker 1\\n分区 0 Leader\\n分区 2 Follower]&#10;    T --&gt; B2[Broker 2\\n分区 1 Leader\\n分区 0 Follower]&#10;    T --&gt; B3[Broker 3\\n分区 2 Leader\\n分区 1 Follower]&#10;    B1 --&gt; CG[消费者组 A]&#10;    B2 --&gt; CG&#10;    B3 --&gt; CG&#10;    CG --&gt; C1[消费者 1\\n消费分区 0]&#10;    CG --&gt; C2[消费者 2\\n消费分区 1]&#10;    CG --&gt; C3[消费者 3\\n消费分区 2]\">flowchart TB\n    P1[Producer A] --&gt; T[Topic: orders\\n分区 0 / 分区 1 / 分区 2]\n    P2[Producer B] --&gt; T\n    T --&gt; B1[Broker 1\\n分区 0 Leader\\n分区 2 Follower]\n    T --&gt; B2[Broker 2\\n分区 1 Leader\\n分区 0 Follower]\n    T --&gt; B3[Broker 3\\n分区 2 Leader\\n分区 1 Follower]\n    B1 --&gt; CG[消费者组 A]\n    B2 --&gt; CG\n    B3 --&gt; CG\n    CG --&gt; C1[消费者 1\\n消费分区 0]\n    CG --&gt; C2[消费者 2\\n消费分区 1]\n    CG --&gt; C3[消费者 3\\n消费分区 2]</pre><p><strong>关键概念</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Topic</strong>：消息的逻辑分类，物理上分为多个分区</li>\n<li><strong>Partition</strong>：有序、不可变的消息序列；分区是并行的基本单元</li>\n<li><strong>Offset</strong>：消息在分区内的顺序编号，消费者提交 offset 标记已处理位置</li>\n<li><strong>Consumer Group</strong>：同一组内的消费者分担分区消费；一个分区同时只被组内一个消费者消费</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分区策略\">分区策略</h2><p>分区策略决定消息路由到哪个分区，直接影响负载均衡和顺序保证：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Round-Robin（默认）</td>\n<td>轮询分配</td>\n<td>消息无顺序要求，追求均匀负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Key Hash</td>\n<td><code>hash(key) % partitionCount</code></td>\n<td>同 Key 消息保序（如同一用户的操作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义分区器</td>\n<td>业务逻辑决定分区</td>\n<td>按地区、租户等业务维度分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sticky Partitioner</td>\n<td>批次内粘性分配</td>\n<td>减少小批次，提升吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 自定义分区器示例&#10;public class RegionPartitioner implements Partitioner {&#10;    @Override&#10;    public int partition(String topic, Object key, byte[] keyBytes,&#10;                         Object value, byte[] valueBytes, Cluster cluster) {&#10;        String region = extractRegion(keyBytes);&#10;        List&lt;PartitionInfo&gt; partitions = cluster.partitionsForTopic(topic);&#10;        return Math.abs(region.hashCode()) % partitions.size();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自定义分区器示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RegionPartitioner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partitioner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> partition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Object </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keyBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                         Object </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">valueBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Cluster </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cluster</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        String region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractRegion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(keyBytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PartitionInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> partitions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">partitionsForTopic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(topic);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(region.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hashCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> partitions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"副本机制与-isr\">副本机制与 ISR</h2><p>Kafka 通过副本（Replication）保证消息不丢失：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Leader Replica</strong>：负责所有读写请求</li>\n<li><strong>Follower Replica</strong>：从 Leader 同步数据，Leader 故障时参与选举</li>\n<li><strong>ISR（In-Sync Replicas）</strong>：与 Leader 保持同步的副本集合，Leader 只向 ISR 内的副本同步</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"# 生产者持久性配置&#10;acks=all                    # 等待所有 ISR 副本确认&#10;min.insync.replicas=2       # 至少 2 个 ISR 副本确认才算成功&#10;retries=3&#10;retry.backoff.ms=1000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 生产者持久性配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>acks=all                    # 等待所有 ISR 副本确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>min.insync.replicas=2       # 至少 2 个 ISR 副本确认才算成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>retries=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>retry.backoff.ms=1000</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>副本数与可用性关系</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>副本数（N）</th>\n<th>可容忍故障数</th>\n<th>写延迟</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>开发环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>生产环境（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>关键业务数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消费者组与-rebalance\">消费者组与 Rebalance</h2><p>消费者加入或退出组时，触发<strong>Rebalance</strong>——重新分配分区。Rebalance 期间所有消费者停止消费，是性能的主要影响因素：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant GC as Group Coordinator&#10;    participant C1 as Consumer 1&#10;    participant C2 as Consumer 2(新加入)&#10;&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;GC: JoinGroup Request&#10;    GC-&gt;&gt;C1: 触发 Rebalance&#10;    GC-&gt;&gt;C2: 触发 Rebalance&#10;    Note over GC: 等待所有成员 JoinGroup&#10;    GC--&gt;&gt;C1: 分配分区 [P0, P1]&#10;    GC--&gt;&gt;C2: 分配分区 [P2, P3]&#10;    C1-&gt;&gt;GC: SyncGroup&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;GC: SyncGroup&#10;    Note over C1,C2: 消费暂停期结束,恢复消费\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant GC as Group Coordinator\n    participant C1 as Consumer 1\n    participant C2 as Consumer 2(新加入)\n\n    C2-&gt;&gt;GC: JoinGroup Request\n    GC-&gt;&gt;C1: 触发 Rebalance\n    GC-&gt;&gt;C2: 触发 Rebalance\n    Note over GC: 等待所有成员 JoinGroup\n    GC--&gt;&gt;C1: 分配分区 [P0, P1]\n    GC--&gt;&gt;C2: 分配分区 [P2, P3]\n    C1-&gt;&gt;GC: SyncGroup\n    C2-&gt;&gt;GC: SyncGroup\n    Note over C1,C2: 消费暂停期结束,恢复消费</pre><p><strong>减少 Rebalance 的配置</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>session.timeout.ms</code>：消费者心跳超时时间（默认 45s，适当调大）</li>\n<li><code>heartbeat.interval.ms</code>：心跳间隔（建议为 session.timeout 的 1/3）</li>\n<li><code>max.poll.interval.ms</code>：两次 poll 之间的最大间隔（处理慢时调大）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"kafka-性能调优\">Kafka 性能调优</h2><p><strong>生产者端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"# 批量发送提升吞吐&#10;batch.size=65536          # 批次大小 64KB&#10;linger.ms=5               # 等待 5ms 收集批次&#10;buffer.memory=67108864    # 生产者缓冲区 64MB&#10;compression.type=snappy   # 启用压缩（CPU 换带宽）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 批量发送提升吞吐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>batch.size=65536          # 批次大小 64KB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>linger.ms=5               # 等待 5ms 收集批次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>buffer.memory=67108864    # 生产者缓冲区 64MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compression.type=snappy   # 启用压缩（CPU 换带宽）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>消费者端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"fetch.min.bytes=1024      # 最小拉取字节数，减少空轮询&#10;fetch.max.wait.ms=500     # 等待数据的最长时间&#10;max.partition.fetch.bytes=1048576  # 单分区最大拉取 1MB&#10;auto.offset.reset=earliest          # 无 offset 时从最早开始&#10;enable.auto.commit=false            # 手动提交，避免消息丢失\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fetch.min.bytes=1024      # 最小拉取字节数，减少空轮询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fetch.max.wait.ms=500     # 等待数据的最长时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max.partition.fetch.bytes=1048576  # 单分区最大拉取 1MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>auto.offset.reset=earliest          # 无 offset 时从最早开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enable.auto.commit=false            # 手动提交，避免消息丢失</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Broker 端</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>建议值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>log.retention.hours</code></td>\n<td>168（7天）</td>\n<td>日志保留时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log.segment.bytes</code></td>\n<td>1GB</td>\n<td>单段文件大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>num.partitions</code></td>\n<td>CPU核心数 × 2</td>\n<td>默认分区数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>num.replica.fetchers</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>副本同步线程数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消费者-lag-监控\">消费者 Lag 监控</h2><p>消费者 Lag（积压）是衡量系统健康度的核心指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看消费者组 Lag&#10;kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 \\&#10;  --group my-consumer-group --describe&#10;&#10;# 输出示例&#10;TOPIC     PARTITION  CURRENT-OFFSET  LOG-END-OFFSET  LAG&#10;orders    0          10000           10050           50&#10;orders    1          9980            10020           40\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看消费者组 Lag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kafka-consumer-groups.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bootstrap-server</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> localhost:9092</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --group</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-consumer-group</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --describe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TOPIC</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  CURRENT-OFFSET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  LOG-END-OFFSET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  LAG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          10000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">           10050</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">           50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          9980</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            10020</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">           40</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 Lag 持续增长时，扩容消费者（增加到与分区数相同）是最直接的手段。与<a href=\"../engineering/backpressure-flow-control\">背压与流量控制</a>结合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Kafka 的核心优势在于高吞吐、持久化存储和分区并行。合理设置分区策略、副本数和 ISR 参数是保证正确性的基础；批量发送、压缩和消费者并发是提升吞吐的核心手段；消费者 Lag 监控是判断系统健康的关键指标。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kafka 深度实践","id":"kafka-深度实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心架构","id":"核心架构"},{"level":2,"text":"分区策略","id":"分区策略"},{"level":2,"text":"副本机制与 ISR","id":"副本机制与-isr"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者组与 Rebalance","id":"消费者组与-rebalance"},{"level":2,"text":"Kafka 性能调优","id":"kafka-性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者 Lag 监控","id":"消费者-lag-监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"死信队列与消息错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/dead-letter-queue"},"next":{"title":"RabbitMQ 模式与高可用配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/rabbitmq-patterns"}}